[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17825.628, "timestamp": "04:57:05", "text": "50,000。哦，差不多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17829.83, "timestamp": "04:57:09", "text": "30,000。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17831.51, "timestamp": "04:57:11", "text": "这样就足够了吧？购买"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17834.39, "timestamp": "04:57:14", "text": "必需品等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17839.708, "timestamp": "04:57:19", "text": "呃，不。它基本上就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17842.59, "timestamp": "04:57:22", "text": "为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17845.628, "timestamp": "04:57:25", "text": "幸存下来。不像我，我没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17849.43, "timestamp": "04:57:29", "text": "除了像扩展程序之类的东西，买很多其他东西。出色地，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17853.11, "timestamp": "04:57:33", "text": "不是扩展程序，而是我的适配器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17856.47, "timestamp": "04:57:36", "text": "比如充电器，我的笔记本电脑充电器和我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17858.59, "timestamp": "04:57:38", "text": "手机充电器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17861.788, "timestamp": "04:57:41", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17865.83, "timestamp": "04:57:45", "text": "是的，我刚买了那些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17866.67, "timestamp": "04:57:46", "text": "那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17870.19, "timestamp": "04:57:50", "text": "它。我必须活下去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17875.03, "timestamp": "04:57:55", "text": "那。然后我就收到了家里的钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17879.19, "timestamp": "04:57:59", "text": "就像我父母给我寄钱，直到……"}]